  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Our morning's exertions had been too much for me, and by afternoon I was tired out.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Every time I closed my eyes I saw the dead man's distorted face before me.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.583,
      "seconds": 6.06
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "If ever human features bespoke vice of the most malignant type, they were certainly his.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 14.167,
      "seconds": 6.49
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Holmes was very late in returning. Dinner was on the table before he appeared.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 21.958,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "What's the matter? You are not looking quite yourself. This Brixton Road affair has upset you.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 27.833,
      "seconds": 5.63
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "To tell the truth, it has. I ought to be more case-hardened after Afghanistan.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 35.0,
      "seconds": 5.41
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The papers had not mentioned the wedding ring that fell when the body was raised.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 41.917,
      "seconds": 4.16
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had sent the advertisement to every paper that morning, and signed it with my name.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 47.5,
      "seconds": 5.1
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He handed me a plain gold band. It was, he said, almost a facsimile.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 53.917,
      "seconds": 6.04
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He told me to clean my old service revolver and load it, and I did.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 61.292,
      "seconds": 4.99
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The man would be desperate, he said, and it was as well to be ready.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 66.792,
      "seconds": 4.14
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "When I came back the table was cleared and he was scraping upon his violin.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 72.167,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "At eight o'clock there was a sharp ring at the bell, and he rose softly.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 77.542,
      "seconds": 4.38
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The footfall on the stair was an uncertain and shuffling one, and it came slowly.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 82.458,
      "seconds": 5.72
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Instead of the man of violence we expected, a very old and wrinkled woman hobbled in.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 88.708,
      "seconds": 5.9
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "My companion's face had gone so disconsolate that I could hardly keep my countenance.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 95.125,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She stood blinking at us with her bleared eyes, fumbling in her pocket with shaky fingers.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 101.125,
      "seconds": 6.98
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She drew out an evening paper and pointed at our advertisement with one knuckled finger.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 108.625,
      "seconds": 5.99
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Here is your ring, Mrs Sawyer. I am glad to restore it to its owner.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 115.917,
      "seconds": 5.3
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She had hardly shuffled off before he was into an ulster and down the stair.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 122.75,
      "seconds": 5.58
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "From the window I could see her walking feebly, her pursuer some little distance behind.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 128.833,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "She hailed a four-wheeler, he said, and called her address across the whole street.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 134.833,
      "seconds": 5.41
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "When the driver opened the door at Houndsditch, there was nobody inside the cab at all.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 141.667,
      "seconds": 4.69
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "Old woman be damned. We were the old women, to be so taken in by an actor.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 148.292,
      "seconds": 4.82
    }
  ]
}